Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.00,0:00:16.04,Main,,0,0,0,,In this world, there are many mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.04,0:00:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if they are all called mages,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.67,0:00:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,there are the novices who\Ncan only do simple magic,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:24.71,Main,,0,0,0,,the apprentice witches,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,and the full witches, who are at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.25,0:00:32.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is the beautiful girl wearing\Na brooch that signals her status as a witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:37.79,Main,,0,0,0,,whose ashen hair flutters in the wind,\Nshining so much with beauty and talent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.79,0:00:43.96,Main,,0,0,0,,that even the sun's eyes squint involuntarily?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.96,0:00:46.75,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:27.96,MainTop,,0,0,0,,"The Land of Mages"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.38,0:02:36.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Land of Mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.33,0:02:39.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, come in, Madam Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need to check anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:46.29,Main,,0,0,0,,No, since only mages can\Nget here in the first place,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:50.71,Main,,0,0,0,,and that brooch is proof that\Nyou're a witch, Madam Ashen Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:53.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I see. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.21,0:03:00.63,Main,,0,0,0,,As you might guess from the name,\Nonly mages can enter the Land of Mages,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:03.83,Main,,0,0,0,,so I heard that witches, as the highest\Nranking mages, are especially respected
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,and are looked upon with\Nenvious gazes and fawned over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:14.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been looking forward\Nto visiting this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.54,0:03:23.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Flying in the sky is recommended, it looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.08,0:03:33.50,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a very elegant city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:34.83,Main,,0,0,0,,--Now, first, I'll look for a place to--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.83,0:03:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--No...!\N--Now, first, I'll look for a place to--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.92,0:03:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,--No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:54.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.58,0:03:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What's with this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:04:00.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, um, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.79,0:04:04.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.58,0:04:07.13,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't fix this many roof tiles...!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.13,0:04:09.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you should apologize first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.75,0:04:13.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry! I'm so, so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.33,0:04:14.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:18.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but what about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.33,0:04:19.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.96,0:04:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:28.04,Main,,0,0,0,,As you can see, I'm fit as a fiddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.75,0:04:33.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.42,0:04:34.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:39.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fix the roof tiles, so please rest a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.08,0:04:40.83,Main,,0,0,0,,No, I'll help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.83,0:04:41.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:42.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:44.29,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.29,0:04:46.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.71,0:04:49.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.92,0:05:15.42,Main,,0,0,0,,A time-reversing spell!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.42,0:05:16.50,Main,,0,0,0,,All fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.50,0:05:18.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.42,0:05:20.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You're next.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.13,0:05:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wow, I'm healed!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Being able to do this\Nmuch is normal for a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:39.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:41.54,Main,,0,0,0,,U-Um...!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.54,0:05:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Make sure you check your\Nsurroundings when you're flying.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.79,0:05:47.42,Main,,0,0,0,,P-P-Please, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.42,0:05:49.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, is there\Nanything I can do to apologize?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.92,0:05:54.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, take care of yourself,\Nmage-whose-name-I-do-not-know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:02.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, to find a place to stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.17,0:06:06.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, that place looks splendid and fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:10.63,Main,,0,0,0,,What if they're like,\N"Madam Witch, no payment is necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.63,0:06:13.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, won't you grace us with your presence?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.25,0:06:15.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.46,0:06:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Please, leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.50,0:06:22.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You cannot stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.38,0:06:25.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.38,0:06:31.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss, I'm sorry, but please find\Na place more suitable for you to stay at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:36.83,Main,,0,0,0,,What's this...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.92,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Far from being fawned over,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:44.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been getting kicked out\Nof every place I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.04,0:06:45.75,Main,,0,0,0,,This is the last place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like there\Nare any other hotels around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.13,0:06:50.96,Main,,0,0,0,,A run-down place like\Nthis should take me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.96,0:06:53.54,Main,,0,0,0,,It should, right...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.50,0:07:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Welcome...?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.17,0:07:19.50,Main,,0,0,0,,You're the witch from earlier! I-I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Are you here for retribution?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:21.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You are, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.79,0:07:22.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.63,0:07:24.42,Main,,0,0,0,,--Please, just spare my life...\Njust spare my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.42,0:07:25.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--Um...\N--Please, just spare my life...\Njust spare my life...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,A-Are you going to tear off\Neverything below my shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,--No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.17,0:07:35.38,Main,,0,0,0,,--I'm just looking for a place to stay.\N--No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:36.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:39.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:42.71,Main,,0,0,0,,You saved me the trouble\Nof going to look for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.71,0:07:45.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Please enter your name in the register.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.58,0:07:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I really am sorry about earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:52.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina, I wanted to thank you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.63,0:07:54.33,Main,,0,0,0,,"Miss Elaina"?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.33,0:07:56.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.58,0:07:57.88,Main,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.88,0:08:00.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, my name's Saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Is there anything I can do to thank you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.29,0:08:05.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,It'd be great if you could give me more\Nthan just the normal witch's discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.92,0:08:11.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.96,0:08:14.92,Main,,0,0,0,,--Then, I'll take your things\Nto your room. Here's the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:17.04,Main,,0,0,0,,--Huh?\N--Then, I'll take your things\Nto your room. Here's the key...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.04,0:08:20.00,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gone... gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.00,0:08:21.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Gone, gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.17,0:08:26.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I lost my brooch...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why the other places\Nnot only didn't fawn over me,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.29,0:08:32.71,Main,,0,0,0,,but they also treated me coldly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.71,0:08:34.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.83,0:08:37.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't see it here, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.71,0:08:41.42,Main,,0,0,0,,We've looked so much,\Nbut we still can't find it...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.38,0:08:51.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Miss Fran...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:53.46,Main,,0,0,0,,What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:57.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I lost something so important...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.38,0:09:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing in my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.38,0:09:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a favor to ask, so I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.75,0:09:11.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd locked the door, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Heh, you forget that I work here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.46,0:09:21.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Just what do you think you're doing,\Ncoming into my room without permission?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.58,0:09:23.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.33,0:09:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Meanie...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.33,0:09:29.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Well? What was the favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:39.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Madam Witch, please teach me what I need\Nto know to pass the apprentice witch exams!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.54,0:09:43.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, what's with that pose you've been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.75,0:09:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,This is a traditional way of prostrating\Nyourself from my country called "{\i1}dogeza{\i0}."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.00,0:09:49.71,Main,,0,0,0,,"{\i1}Dogeza{\i0}"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.71,0:09:52.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's a strange tradition.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.04,0:09:55.63,Main,,0,0,0,,But it does feel sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.63,0:09:58.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, tell me about your situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.25,0:10:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.58,0:10:03.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I have a little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.25,0:10:05.67,Main,,0,0,0,,She's the cute girl in the picture!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.67,0:10:06.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.71,0:10:09.92,Main,,0,0,0,,We're from a land in the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.92,0:10:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,We came together from afar\Nto become apprentice witches...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.79,0:10:16.29,Main,,0,0,0,,From afar...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.29,0:10:21.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We worked at this hotel to save up money\Nas we took the exams over and over...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.75,0:10:27.08,Main,,0,0,0,,So the two of you are still\Nnovices after all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Is your sister out right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,She passed the last exams\Nand went back home first...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.58,0:10:39.63,Main,,0,0,0,,So you panicked because your\Ndear little sister got ahead of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:43.63,Main,,0,0,0,,so you thought you'd ask a witch\Nyou happened to meet for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.63,0:10:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:49.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Well... I suppose that's how it turned out...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.75,0:10:52.21,Main,,0,0,0,,When's the next test?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:53.71,Main,,0,0,0,,In one week...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.71,0:10:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,A week...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:11:02.63,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, I can teach you until\NI find my brooch, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:04.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:07.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.50,0:11:12.50,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, I became Saya's teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.17,Main,,0,0,0,,"Teacher"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.17,0:11:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,It has an unexpectedly nice ring to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.79,Main,,0,0,0,,In order for a novice to\Nbecome an apprentice witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.79,0:11:24.58,Main,,0,0,0,,she must first pass a written exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.58,0:11:29.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I hate to say it, but you can pass\Nthe written test with a night of cramming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,The problem is the second test--the magic test.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.08,0:11:38.08,Main,,0,0,0,,You have to keep flying on your\Nbroom and exchange nonlethal attacks,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.08,0:11:41.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and only the one who wins in the end can pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.67,Main,,0,0,0,,She then officially becomes an apprentice witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.67,0:11:48.21,Main,,0,0,0,,I never want to take a test like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.21,0:11:51.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me give it to you straight, Saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.08,0:11:53.21,Main,,0,0,0,,With your current abilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.21,0:11:56.67,Main,,0,0,0,,the likelihood of you passing\Nthe magic test is close to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:59.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't give it to me so straight!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.92,0:12:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,But since it's "close to zero,"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:05.00,Main,,0,0,0,,it's not zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.00,0:12:07.75,Main,,0,0,0,,So you're saying it's possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.75,0:12:13.58,Main,,0,0,0,,First, you need to be able to maneuver\Nyour broom as well as or better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.58,0:12:17.42,Main,,0,0,0,,What? That's pretty tough...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.42,0:12:19.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Please don't act so spoiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:21.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you want it to end with you\Ngetting knocked off your broom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:24.79,Main,,0,0,0,,right after the exam starts?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.58,0:12:29.42,Main,,0,0,0,,Next is turning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.42,0:12:33.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Shift your weight and turn adroitly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:34.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.08,0:12:38.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Next are sudden breaks and starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.58,0:12:41.29,Main,,0,0,0,,After forcing the broom to\Na stop with your whole body,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,pretend you're kicking\Nthe air and shoot back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.38,0:12:52.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Next is breaking away in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.88,0:12:55.54,Main,,0,0,0,,After letting go of your broom in midair,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.54,0:12:58.38,Main,,0,0,0,,use magic to call it back to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.42,0:13:04.50,Main,,0,0,0,,If it looks like you're in danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.50,0:13:08.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll go help you, so you can fly without worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.25,0:13:24.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya was able to fly about\Nas well as me in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.29,0:13:26.29,Main,,0,0,0,,You can do it after all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.29,0:13:32.46,Main,,0,0,0,,This must be how a mother feels\Nwhen she's teaching her child to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.75,Main,,0,0,0,,But,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.75,0:13:36.38,Main,,0,0,0,,to be able to do it so quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:40.58,Main,,0,0,0,,What has she been doing up until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.58,0:13:43.83,Main,,0,0,0,,You practiced hard today, too, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.83,0:13:47.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Well then, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.88,0:13:53.38,Main,,0,0,0,,This is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.38,0:13:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.83,0:14:00.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I-I didn't think it'd be mixed in...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.58,0:14:02.96,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't like mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.96,0:14:06.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I {\i1}hate {\i0}them! I mean, they grow from trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.50,0:14:09.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Which means, they're {\i1}trees{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.00,0:14:12.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I am {\i1}not {\i0}in the habit of eating trees!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.58,0:14:15.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If you're a picky eater,\Nyou can't become a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.79,0:14:16.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.88,0:14:19.71,Main,,0,0,0,,If you want to become an apprentice witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.71,0:14:24.83,Main,,0,0,0,,you must have the ability to\Nendure eating even foods you don't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:26.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:27.38,Main,,0,0,0,,Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.38,0:14:31.42,Main,,0,0,0,,So think of this as training and eat them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:37.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm in hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:56.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, I'll use wind magic to\Nmake the fruit from that tree drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Please try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.21,0:15:02.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.92,0:15:11.38,Main,,0,0,0,,You must be able to use attack magic precisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.38,0:15:15.67,Main,,0,0,0,,This is an actual, slightly\Nunderhanded--I mean, clever--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:18.75,Main,,0,0,0,,trick I used in the actual magic exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.75,0:15:21.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Use wind magic to change the flow of the air
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.46,0:15:24.38,Main,,0,0,0,,and block the way of the other examinees.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.38,0:15:26.38,Main,,0,0,0,,It's unexpectedly effective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.38,0:15:28.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I see! Just what I'd expect\Nfrom you, Miss Elaina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:32.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you were\Nexpecting, but try it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:34.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:44.46,Main,,0,0,0,,To master it, you need your body\Nto remember how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.46,0:15:46.50,Main,,0,0,0,,M-My body...?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:50.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Like this. Gently, softly...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.00,0:15:53.17,Main,,0,0,0,,P-Please be kind to me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.17,0:15:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:58.17,Main,,0,0,0,,Wind magic!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.67,0:16:04.42,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, for the next few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.42,0:16:10.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I searched for my brooch\Nin between Saya's training.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.58,0:16:18.79,Main,,0,0,0,,It's really nowhere to be found...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.17,0:16:27.29,Main,,0,0,0,,I saw your witch's brooch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:28.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Where did you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.96,0:16:31.96,Main,,0,0,0,,Please tell me, lovely lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:35.17,Main,,0,0,0,,I've been forgetting things a lot recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:38.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? Look what I found...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.58,0:16:42.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh! I remember now! I remember--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.33,0:16:45.04,Main,,0,0,0,,This is what I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.25,0:16:56.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.00,0:16:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Um, Miss Elaina...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.08,0:16:59.67,Main,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.67,0:17:03.33,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Can I sleep with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.33,0:17:05.08,Main,,0,0,0,,There's not much space.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.08,0:17:07.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry this is such a cheap place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:10.04,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not what I meant...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.04,0:17:13.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you can if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.46,0:17:15.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.58,0:17:29.25,Main,,0,0,0,,You've improved a lot, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.25,0:17:32.92,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't need my help anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.92,0:17:35.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.58,0:17:40.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I still have a lot of things\NI want you to teach me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm a traveler.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.04,0:17:45.50,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving this country soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.50,0:17:50.08,Main,,0,0,0,,But until then, we'll always be together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:55.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Please teach me a lot more,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.71,0:17:57.79,Main,,0,0,0,,about a lot of things.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.08,0:18:02.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You're asking for too much, Saya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.79,0:18:03.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.92,0:18:07.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you please return my brooch?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:11.79,Main,,0,0,0,,You improved too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.79,0:18:14.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought it was because I was good at teaching,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.79,0:18:16.67,Main,,0,0,0,,but that wasn't the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.67,0:18:20.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You were able to ride\Na broom properly from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.54,0:18:23.54,Main,,0,0,0,,You came from a faraway land, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.54,0:18:27.63,Main,,0,0,0,,If you were bad at flying,\Nthen how did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.63,0:18:33.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes, when I heard what the\Nwoman said, everything made sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.04,Main,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:45.46,Main,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.25,0:19:03.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't tie someone down\Nusing misguided methods like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.54,0:19:10.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I was lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.75,0:19:14.58,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not your little sister, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:17.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.00,0:19:18.96,Main,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.96,0:19:23.25,Main,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be together with someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.25,0:19:25.83,Main,,0,0,0,,I hated being alone so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.83,0:19:27.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I was scared...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.71,0:19:30.46,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why I--Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.17,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.17,0:19:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.58,0:19:37.54,Main,,0,0,0,,When you are seriously\Ntrying to accomplish something,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.54,0:19:39.83,Main,,0,0,0,,you will always be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.83,0:19:42.88,Main,,0,0,0,,You can't do it if you're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.88,0:19:45.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Once you start being friendly, it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's hard to fight alone, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.21,Main,,0,0,0,,It's scary, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.21,0:19:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,I know that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.38,Main,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:19:59.21,Main,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:00.42,Main,,0,0,0,,You may have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:01.50,Main,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.50,0:20:03.79,Main,,0,0,0,,So that you'll be fine even if you're alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.79,0:20:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,please allow me to leave\Na part of me by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.92,0:20:10.67,Main,,0,0,0,,But, this is yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.67,0:20:12.67,Main,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.29,0:20:16.79,Main,,0,0,0,,That's my spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:19.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, we match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.46,0:20:22.33,Main,,0,0,0,,After this, you will be by yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.33,0:20:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,But, you will not be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:32.08,Main,,0,0,0,,People like your sister and me\Nare all watching over you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.96,0:20:39.46,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll pay for your whole hotel stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.46,0:20:42.08,Main,,0,0,0,,...out of my own wages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.17,0:20:45.79,Main,,0,0,0,,If I don't have enough,\NI'll pay in installments...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:58.58,Main,,0,0,0,,And so, we spent our last night together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.58,0:21:01.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I soothed the sobbing girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.08,0:21:04.79,Main,,0,0,0,,and taught her ways to make\Nit through the magic exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.79,0:21:07.21,Main,,0,0,0,,She told me about her little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.21,0:21:10.33,Main,,0,0,0,,and I told her of my journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.33,0:21:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Saya looked so fragile
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:15.21,Main,,0,0,0,,and helpless...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.21,0:21:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I felt like I was looking at my past self.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.54,Main,,0,0,0,,Six months have passed since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.54,0:21:44.71,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm now in a country far from the Land of Mages.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.71,0:21:48.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Examinee who successfully passed\Nthe apprentice witch exams...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.50,0:21:54.88,Main,,0,0,0,,The article wrote about her days\Nof anguish and her hopes for the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.42,Main,,0,0,0,,About her little sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.42,0:22:01.25,Main,,0,0,0,,about how she met a traveler and received\Ncourage to fight alone and a hat,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.25,0:22:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,and how she finally became an apprentice witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.13,0:22:05.75,Main,,0,0,0,,And--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.75,0:22:07.92,Main,,0,0,0,,When I become a full witch,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.92,0:22:11.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to go see the traveler that I love!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.29,0:22:18.67,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm waiting patiently for you\Nas I continue on my journey, Saya.
